Point the KosmicKrisp Vulkan manifest at MoltenVK

The wrapper ships two Vulkan driver manifests in Resources/vulkan/icd.d, one for
MoltenVK and one for KosmicKrisp. Its launcher hands the KosmicKrisp one to the
Vulkan loader (VK_DRIVER_FILES), and KSA crashes on that driver. This makes that
manifest load MoltenVK instead. When the loader is not used the manifest is never
read, so there is no effect.

Remove once the wrapper lets the driver be chosen.
---
 Resources/vulkan/icd.d/kosmickrisp_mesa_icd.json | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/wrapper:Resources/vulkan/icd.d/kosmickrisp_mesa_icd.json b/wrapper:Resources/vulkan/icd.d/kosmickrisp_mesa_icd.json
--- a/wrapper:Resources/vulkan/icd.d/kosmickrisp_mesa_icd.json
+++ b/wrapper:Resources/vulkan/icd.d/kosmickrisp_mesa_icd.json
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 {
     "ICD": {
-        "api_version": "1.4.363",
-        "library_path": "../../../Frameworks/libvulkan_kosmickrisp.dylib"
+        "api_version": "1.4.0",
+        "library_path": "../../../Frameworks/libMoltenVK.dylib"
     },
     "file_format_version": "1.0.1"
 }
